      "id": 7,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "NOTE 1 · 全局时间线只建立一次",
      "pos": [1870, 0],
      "size": [620, 270],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## Prompt Relay不会在每段重新开始\nPlan的`length`要覆盖整条视频；当前30秒输入会自动向上对齐到H3帧网格。节点按`本段起点 - context_frames`投影同一个全局Plan。启用Relay时，内循环节点里的`global_prompt`与`segment_prompts_json`保持为空。"],
      "color": "#73551e",
      "bgcolor": "#35270e"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "NOTE 2 · EAV首版固定Stock20",
      "pos": [1870, 320],
      "size": [620, 270],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## 不接Turbo LoRA，固定20步\n当前EAV组合只接受`20步 + dual_clock_euler + native_flow`。`report_only`只记录测量，`apply_exp`才应用FETA。Long Video负责上下文/layout；组合器内部按`Prompt Relay → FETA`执行，只有一个注意力所有者。"],
      "color": "#214d35",
      "bgcolor": "#12281d"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "NOTE 3 · 每段审计后才接受",
      "pos": [1870, 640],
      "size": [620, 290],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## 失败不会污染已完成段\n每段使用新的EAV Runtime；完整NFE/活跃block审计通过后，才写入带SHA绑定的`effects_audit.json`并接受候选。中断、OOM或重启后保持全部参数和`chain_id`不变再运行，已接受段不会重算。改变模型、提示、参考或效果参数时必须换新的`chain_id`。"],
      "color": "#604b1d",
      "bgcolor": "#332810"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "NOTE 4 · 显存与音频边界",
      "pos": [1870, 980],
      "size": [620, 310],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 9,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## 严格串行，不等于绝不会OOM\n每次只保留当前段，已完成历史在磁盘；`minimum_free_vram_mib=512`仅是进入下一段前的余量门，不是峰值保证。节点不调用全局模型卸载。FETA不直接缩放音频行，但H3是联合AV Transformer，Relay和共享层仍可能间接改变声音，最终长片必须试听。需要逐段挑片时继续使用旧Accepted/Background路线。"],
      "color": "#6b3030",
      "bgcolor": "#371919"
    }
